%% 阅读器 App v1.1 增量 — 关键调用流程时序图
%% 见 docs/system_design.md §4

%% ── ① EPUB 导入完整流程 ──
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant ID as ImportDialog
    participant IM as ImportManager
    participant EP as EpubParser
    participant ZF as ZipFile(java.util.zip)
    participant XP as XmlPullParser
    participant Repo as BookRepository
    participant FS as FileSystem(filesDir/cover/)

    U->>ID: 选择 .epub 文件
    ID->>ID: copyUriToCache(content://uri) → /cache/imports/xxx.epub
    ID->>IM: importArchives(["/cache/imports/xxx.epub"])
    IM->>IM: ArchiveExtractor.extract() → 识别 .epub，不解压直接返回路径
    IM->>IM: importFiles(paths) → 检测扩展名 ".epub"

    Note over IM,EP: EPUB 解析开始
    IM->>EP: parse(epubPath, UTF-8)
    EP->>ZF: ZipFile(epubPath)
    EP->>ZF: getEntry("META-INF/container.xml")
    EP->>XP: 解析 container.xml → 获取 OPF 路径 (如 "OEBPS/content.opf")
    EP->>ZF: getEntry("OEBPS/content.opf")
    EP->>XP: 解析 OPF XML
    Note over EP,XP: &lt;metadata&gt; → dc:title, dc:creator
    Note over EP,XP: &lt;manifest&gt; → 所有 item (id, href, media-type)
    Note over EP,XP: &lt;spine&gt; → itemref 顺序

    EP->>EP: 查找 cover: manifest item 中 id 含 "cover" 或 properties="cover-image"
    alt 找到封面
        EP->>ZF: getEntry(coverHref) → 读取 bytes
        EP-->>EP: coverImageBytes
    else 无封面
        EP-->>EP: coverImageBytes = null
    end

    loop 每个 spine itemref
        EP->>ZF: getEntry(itemHref) → HTML 内容
        EP->>EP: stripHtml(html) → 纯文本
        EP->>EP: 检测章节标题 (h1-h6 / TOC 规则) → 切章
        EP-->>EP: EpubChapter(title, content, charCount)
    end

    EP-->>IM: EpubParseResult(metadata, chapters)

    Note over IM,FS: 封面保存
    alt metadata.coverImageBytes != null
        IM->>Repo: saveCoverImage(context, bookId, bytes)
        Repo->>FS: write filesDir/cover/{bookId}.png
        Repo-->>IM: coverUri = "file:///.../cover/{bookId}.png"
    else 无封面
        IM->>IM: coverUri = null (BookCover 将使用默认占位)
    end

    IM->>Repo: upsertBook(BookEntity(title=metadata.title, author=metadata.author, format="epub", coverUri=..., totalChapters=chapters.size, totalChars=...))
    Repo-->>IM: done

    IM-->>ID: count = 1
    ID->>U: Snackbar "已导入 1 本"

%% ── ② 阅读面板弹出/收起 ──
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant RC as ReaderContent
    participant RS as ReaderScreen
    participant RT as ReaderTopBar
    participant RB as ReaderBottomBar
    participant CZ as ClickZoneHandler

    Note over RS: 初始状态: isPanelVisible = false
    Note over RC: TopBar/BottomBar 隐藏 (AnimatedVisibility.Gone)

    U->>RC: 点击屏幕中间区域
    RC->>CZ: detectTapGestures → zoneFromOffset(x/w, y/h)
    CZ-->>RC: zone = CENTER
    RC->>RS: onPanelToggle()
    RS->>RS: isPanelVisible = !isPanelVisible → true
    RS->>RT: AnimatedVisibility(visible=true) → slideInVertically
    RS->>RB: AnimatedVisibility(visible=true) → slideInVertically
    Note over RT,RB: 顶部栏和底部栏从屏幕边缘滑入，动画 300ms

    Note over RT: 顶部栏显示: [←返回] 书名 [···]
    Note over RB: 底部栏显示: [☀] [◀ 章节名 ▸] [排版]

    U->>RT: 点击 [···] 溢出菜单
    RT->>RT: DropdownMenu(搜索🔍, 书签🔖)
    U->>RT: 点击 搜索🔍
    RT->>RS: onSearch() → SearchSheet 弹出

    U->>RB: 点击 ☀ 太阳图标
    RB->>RB: DropdownMenu(亮度Slider, 背景色ChipRow, 日夜模式Switch)
    U->>RB: 拖动亮度 Slider
    RB->>RB: AppPrefs.setBrightness(value) → 实时生效

    U->>RB: 点击 排版 键
    RB->>RB: ModalBottomSheet(字号/边距/对齐/字体)
    U->>RB: 调字号 Slider
    RB->>RB: AppPrefs.setFontScale(value) → 触发 ReaderViewModel 重排

    U->>RC: 再次点击屏幕中间
    RC->>RS: onPanelToggle()
    RS->>RS: isPanelVisible = false
    RS->>RT: AnimatedVisibility(visible=false) → slideOutVertically
    RS->>RB: AnimatedVisibility(visible=false) → slideOutVertically
    Note over RC: 面板隐藏，阅读区全屏

%% ── ③ 最近阅读去重 + 个人页展示 ──
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant MN as MainActivity(NavigationBar)
    participant PS as ProfileScreen
    participant Repo as BookRepository
    participant DAO as ReadingHistoryDao
    participant DB as Room DB

    U->>MN: 点击"个人" Tab
    MN->>PS: 显示 ProfileScreen

    PS->>Repo: getDedupedRecentHistoryFlow()
    Repo->>DAO: getDedupedRecentFlow()
    DAO->>DB: SELECT ... LAG(bookId) OVER (...) ... LIMIT 10
    DB-->>DAO: [h1(bookA), h3(bookB), h5(bookC)] (去重后)
    DAO-->>Repo: List<ReadingHistoryEntity>
    Repo->>Repo: 关联 BookEntity (bookDao.getBooksByIds)
    Repo-->>PS: Flow<List<BookEntity>>

    PS->>PS: LazyRow 展示 3 本最近阅读 (BookCover 卡片)
    Note over PS: 去重效果: bookA 读了 3 次只显示 1 次

    U->>PS: 点击 阅读统计 >
    PS->>MN: navigateTo("stats")
    MN->>StatsScreen: 显示阅读统计页

    U->>PS: 点击 系统设置 >
    PS->>MN: navigateTo("settings")
    MN->>SettingsScreen: 显示设置页

%% ── ④ TOC 规则全局化配置 ──
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant SS as SettingsScreen
    participant TR as TocRuleSettingsScreen
    participant Prefs as AppPrefs(DataStore)
    participant TP as TxtParser

    U->>SS: 设置页 → 点击 "目录规则 >"
    SS->>TR: navigateTo("toc_rules")

    TR->>Prefs: globalTocRules Flow
    Prefs-->>TR: {"rule_chinese_num", "rule_arabic_num"}

    TR->>TR: LazyColumn 列出 TocRules.ALL
    Note over TR: [✓] 中文数字章 (rule_chinese_num)
    Note over TR: [✓] 阿拉伯数字章 (rule_arabic_num)
    Note over TR: [ ] 纯数字编号 (rule_numeric)

    U->>TR: 关闭 "阿拉伯数字章" Switch
    TR->>Prefs: setGlobalTocRules({"rule_chinese_num"})
    Prefs-->>TR: 持久化

    Note over TP: 下次打开任何 TXT 文件时
    TP->>Prefs: 读取 globalTocRules
    TP->>TP: parseWithRules(text, enabledRules) → 仅用中文数字章规则
